{
  "info": {
    "name": "Bananagram - Backend (auth-service + core-service catalogos)",
    "_postman_id": "b4n4n4gr4m-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "description": "Colección para probar en local auth-service (3001) y los endpoints de catálogos de core-service (3002) que trae la rama feat/catalogos-base ya mergeada a develop. El login guarda accessToken/refreshToken en variables de colección automáticamente (ver script de test en 'Login'). Auth Bearer configurado a nivel de colección (usa {{accessToken}}) — cualquier request nueva que agregues hereda el token automáticamente sin que tengas que poner el header a mano; solo Login y Refresh lo desactivan explícitamente (auth: noauth) porque no los necesitan.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "authBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001/api" },
    { "key": "coreBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3002/api" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "20233tn102@utez.edu.mx" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "admin123" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "specialtyId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "socialNetworkId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "auth-service",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.accessToken) { pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken); }",
                  "// OJO: auth.service.ts login() devuelve el registro completo de refresh_tokens,",
                  "// no el string — el campo real a mandar a /auth/refresh es refreshToken.token.",
                  "if (body.refreshToken && body.refreshToken.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken.token); }",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Requiere que packages/seed ya haya corrido (pnpm seed) contra la BD local — el usuario admin sembrado usa adminEmail/adminPassword. No lleva token (auth: noauth) — todavía no existe accessToken en este punto."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] },
            "description": "No lleva token Bearer (auth: noauth) — la identidad aquí viene del refreshToken en el body, no del header Authorization."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (perfil del JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] },
            "description": "Hereda el Bearer {{accessToken}} del auth de la colección — no necesita header propio."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /me/permissions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/me/permissions", "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "permissions"] },
            "description": "Fuente de verdad del menú dinámico del frontend (usePermissions()). Hereda el Bearer {{accessToken}} del auth de la colección."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] },
            "description": "Hereda el Bearer {{accessToken}} del auth de la colección — no necesita header propio."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "core-service - catalogos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Categories",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List categories",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/catalogs/categories", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["catalogs", "categories"] }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Create category",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const body = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (body.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', body.id); }"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Categoría de prueba\"\n}" },
                "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/catalogs/categories", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["catalogs", "categories"] }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Get category by id",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/catalogs/categories/{{categoryId}}", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["catalogs", "categories", "{{categoryId}}"] }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Update category",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Categoría de prueba (editada)\"\n}" },
                "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/catalogs/categories/{{categoryId}}", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["catalogs", "categories", "{{categoryId}}"] }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete category (soft delete)",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/catalogs/categories/{{categoryId}}", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["catalogs", "categories", "{{categoryId}}"] }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
